en started yet!Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:12.82,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:18.78,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:24.20,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:31.42,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:38.74,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.62,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.70,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,koDialogue: 1,0:00:00.30,0:00:00.78,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.38,0:00:00.86,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,osDialogue: 1,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.94,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.54,0:00:01.02,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:00:00.62,0:00:01.10,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:00:00.70,0:00:01.18,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,nhDialogue: 1,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.26,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:00:00.86,0:00:01.34,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.94,0:00:01.42,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.50,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.62,0:00:01.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 100,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.70,0:00:01.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,koDialogue: 101,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,koDialogue: 1,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.28,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 102,0:00:01.28,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:00:00.86,0:00:01.45,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 103,0:00:01.45,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 1,0:00:00.94,0:00:01.60,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 104,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.76,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 105,0:00:01.76,0:00:03.75,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.11,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 106,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.75,Rom