ogue: 1,0:01:24.28,0:01:24.52,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,ohDialogue: 1,0:01:28.87,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,ohDialogue: 1,0:01:24.36,0:01:24.60,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,yeDialogue: 1,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,yeDialogue: 1,0:01:24.44,0:01:24.68,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,sweDialogue: 1,0:01:31.10,0:01:31.34,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,sweDialogue: 1,0:01:24.04,0:01:24.52,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 100,0:01:24.52,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.12,0:01:24.52,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 101,0:01:24.52,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:24.20,0:01:24.87,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,maDialogue: 102,0:01:24.87,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,maDialogue: 1,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.86,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 103,0:01:25.86,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:24.36,0:01:26.20,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,maDialogue: 104,0:01:26.20,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,maDialogue: 1,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.87,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,ohDialogue: 105,0:01:26.87,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,ohDialogue: 1,0:01:24.52,0:01:27.48,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,yesDialogue: 106,0:01:27.48,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,yesDialogue: 1,0:01:24.60,0:01:28.87,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,weDialogue: 107,0:01:28.87,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,weDialogue: 1,0:01:24.68,0:01:30.14,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,can!Dialogue: 108,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.10,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,can!Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.71,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,yeDialogue: 1,0:01:37.89,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 1,0:01:38.44,0:01:38.68,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,caDialogue: 1,0:01:36.99,0:01:37.47,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 100,0:01:37.47,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.07,0:01:37.47,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,yesDialogue: 101,0:01:37.47,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,yesDialogue: 1,0:01:37.15,0:01:37.71,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,weDialogue: 102,0:01:37.71,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,weDialogue: 1,0:01:37.23,0:01:37.89,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,can!Dialogue: 103,0:01:37.89,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,can!Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.59,Title,,0,0,230,,At Rightflank FortressDialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Here comes a Rain-Ruption!Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,A big splash of water?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll cause floods!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Get to high ground!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too late!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:26.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Kin'emon and Kanjuro are climbing the elephant's left leg...Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally, it stopped.Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What was the shaking all about?Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But we're coming to the crucial point.Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on, cat! Nekozaemon!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:43.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The sun is setting, Nekozaemon!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too much for a cat to climb this elephant?Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:55.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Cats are good tree climbers.Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:00.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They are!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Water?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's water overflowing from a Rain-Ruption that poured over the country...Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Water is no good! It will melt Nekozaemon!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no time to lose... But again, halfway to the top, we...Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:35.28,Captions,,0,0,175,,The Whale Forest - Luffy's GroupDialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was a hell of a rain!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rain-Ruptions aren't actually a type of rain.Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Twice a day, Zunesha sprays water on itself.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,So that was a blast of seawater.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:57.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The water passes through a filtration system at the center of the city to aqueductsDialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,and becomes the drinking water for the whole nation.Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:05.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Fish fall along with the seawater, so we never run out of food.Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Rain-Ruptions provide us with a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the bear!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this forest, so can you tell our captain about us and bring him here?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't?Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:31.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Bepo was born here, but since he's a pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,he's now under the care of Master Nekomamushi, the boss of the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:49.42,Captions,,0,0,175,,Kurau City - Zoro and the othersDialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.78,Main,,0,0,3,,It's flooding!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:49.40,Main,,0,0,3,,There's a shark! A shark?! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You went way too high!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is high enough.Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Seawater?Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:59.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe, that was the giant elephant spraying water on itself.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like both the town and the forest are adapted to this water level.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, seeing the water amount... I guess you're right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That means this happens every day...Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:24.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want that tremendous downpour every day!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We must find everybody quickly and get off of this annoying island!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's Luffy! At the edge of the town!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,He's with the Nami-dog girl and the jump rabbit from before!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's being fooled and is being taken to their lair...Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Usopp?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy's been bitten!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! So they're really...Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The water will drain away soon.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I know he's here!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I told you he's not!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:19.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bring him here or this country will be destroyed!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:23.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I really don't know!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What else can I say?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was it?Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:55.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You told me the name of the guy who attacked this country before.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,His name is Jack.Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw his obituary in the newspaper a few days ago.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:08.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It said, after he overran this country,Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,he attacked four Navy ships that were transporting DoflamingoDialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,and sank two of them but they struck back.Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Was he there at Dressrosa?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,He attacked the ships with the Navy admiral and the former fleet admiral on board.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:28.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He must have a screw loose.Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It said his death wasn't confirmed.Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I think he's still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll never forgive Jack!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really foggy.Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Will Zoro and the others be there too?Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I think so.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:59.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I gave them directions to our hidden fortress.Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,ChambresDialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:12.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Where were you bitten?! Do you still have your limbs?Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you Nami-dog girl right there! He's our captain!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna eat him, don't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do that, you predatory tramp!Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:29.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't give us back him and our friends who came here first,Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll see these three swords fire up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I think you have the wrong idea.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's okay. We're here now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Look over there in the fog carefully...Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There are guards and a gate to the fortress.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda! Who are they-gara?Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they the ones who invaded the Whale Forest?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,They didn't mean any harm!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Welcoming Bell didn't ring by mistakeDialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,and one of them got lost in the Whale Forest!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Open the gate and let everybody know!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That the Straw Hats are here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that who they-gara are?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:22.87,Captions,,0,0,175,,Inside the fortressDialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:21.28,Secondary,,0,0,3,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:22.87,Secondary,,0,0,3,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:24.82,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Nami!!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others are here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,They're finally here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:39.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Luffy and the others arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.82,Main,,0,0,0,,They made it safely!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They did?! Really, Chopper?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:49.70,Main,,0,0,0,,They're at the fortress gate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:56.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, your friends are here. That's good.Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:03.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They're important guests!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to welcome our great saviors' friends!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?! What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere's quite upbeat!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't what we heard about!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:55.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What's "Garchu"?Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:58.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought the people of your race hate humans.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Race, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's probably what those who don't know other Minks think and get scared of.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Other Minks?Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,To us, you-teia guys are just Monkey Minks who have less hair.Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:17.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the same Mink Tribe, just a different type.Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so we humans are Monkey Minks.Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:22.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We judge someone by their character, not by their race.Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:34.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We take pride in the hair covering our bodies, but,Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.59,Main,,0,0,0,,you-teia guys have those beautiful...Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:41.11,Main,,0,0,0,,..."lesser mink coats" and quite a lot of us admire it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, look! That's Nami and Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that they're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! I'm happy for you! Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I got caught! Let me through!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:05.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Garchu! Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great! Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,They're very friendly! That's so different from what I expected!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys! I'm so happy to see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:31.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,So Sanji, Brook, and Momo are all fine too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the sun is setting! We can't go any farther today!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm! Let's go back to the ship and climb again tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:15.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I like how you drink! Here, have another cup!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and drink!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's our special "Monkey Wine." It's made from the abundance of fruits in the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:24.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It tastes good!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away, you fools! Don't press yourselves against me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Let's play!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me give you love bites!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me lick you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't be such a baby!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, don't get mad, Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Look how well they're treating us! You're so rude!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:52.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Please overlook these cultural differences. Minkship is a friendly gesture to us.Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's delicious! What kind of meat is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,That's hippo. And these are lizard, alligator, and frog.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:02.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't eat animals with fur.Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:05.99,Main,,0,0,0,,But why do you welcome us like this?Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you-teia guys are our saviors' friends!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Saviors... What happened exactly?Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:17.97,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nooooo!!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What a relief! I read in the newspaper!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're all okay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:39.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to face you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't have a facial surface anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:50.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?! Hey, aren't you with Momo?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, he's okay but it seems like...Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.23,Main,,0,0,0,,...he doesn't really like the Minks.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Doesn't he like these nice people?Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:03.58,Main,,0,0,0,,No. He shuts himself in a room and never comes out.Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's good for us.Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, could I have a word with you?Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.91,0:15:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Come this way.Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you newcomers to Zou, come here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:20.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is Kin'emon-san now?Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He should be arriving soon.Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. That's perfect.Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:33.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to try not to use words like "samurai" or "Wano Country" in this country.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't use them if you can.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If you use those words, you might offend many peopleDialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,and anger them or make them hate you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Offend?Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Anger? Hate?Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why "samurai"...Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, this country was actually...Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I found you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Corpse!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,"Corpse"?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You'll reach the Rightflank Forest! And you'll find the corpse of your-teia friend there!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,C-Corpse?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,So the corpse of a friend...Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.14,Main,,0,0,0,,She was talking about Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We call him so with affection.Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:31.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That's very confusing.Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was surprised...Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was such a tempting race in this world!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Help!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We Dog Minks... h-have a thing for bones!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:46.29,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Stop chewing on me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.57,Main,,0,0,0,,How stupid...Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Luffy, what happened to Tra-guy?Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he went to the Bear Forest.Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! More importantly, what should we do about Sanji-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:07.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, he left a note. So don't you think it's gonna be alright?Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not like he was kidnapped.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried because it didn't look right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We couldn't do anything!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to cry!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you know what, guys? Frankly, we're just confused right now.Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We only have a rough idea of what's going on.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The last time we talked, you guys said you were facing Big Mom's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:44.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we finally got to Zou and there are those talking animals on the elephant's back and the city's ruined!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:48.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought the Mink Tribe was our enemy, but instead, they welcomed us so warmly!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:52.35,Main,,0,0,0,,They even told us we're their saviors' friends!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us everything in detail, Nami?Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:18:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happened to your group since you left Dressrosa eleven days ago?Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I was a little upset.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you everything as it happened.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What we encountered that day off the coast of Dressrosa was...Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,...the Big Mom Pirates' enormous singing ship!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Singing?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.78,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Ship! Ship!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:33.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Their combatants that we could identify were the duo that Luffy met on the Fishman Island.Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! I see Caesar! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's sink their ship and recover just Caesar-soir!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And another one...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Worst Generation.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Capone "Gang" Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:55.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:58.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like they became Big Mom's subordinates.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,They came for Caesar, but he was more scared of them.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,But, frankly speaking, we had no chance to get away from them.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,And we knew they'd take us down if nothing was done!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here with Coup de Burst!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What about Gaon Cannon?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,No! We don't have enough Cola! I have another idea instead!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have an idea, just do it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Help us if you wanna survive!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Let's fight them at the stern and let them drop their guard!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Soul Parade!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Cho-Cho-Cho-Cho-Cho... Chopperemon?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get even with you bastard! How could you use my body like a bag?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:09.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't help you if you don't stop resisting!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:12.02,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,All yours, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Caesar! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they doing-bon?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:25.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,How can he fly?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Poele a Frire...Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.75,Note,,0,0,0,,Frying PanDialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,...Spectre!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.20,Note,,0,0,0,,SpectrumDialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Turn away-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:53.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Ship!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The starboard side's been damaged!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! It's my turn!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Clima-TactDialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:02.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Weather...Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,...Egg!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:08.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Come hatch, rain clouds!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:21.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Rain Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did the weather change in just that area-bon?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna lose them! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Only you guys could do that!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:38.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make me blush, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:40.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That was a white-knuckler!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:42.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That's super!Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Well, it was a big deal I guess but...Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:49.95,Main,,0,0,0,,And how many days did it take to get to Zou from there?Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:51.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We arrived here the next day.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like Zou was nearby at that time.Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,That was 10 days ago.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.53,0:21:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,As far as I could see,Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,the oldest sign of destruction in the city at the center of Zou was...Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:05.51,Main,,0,0,0,,...from a little more than two weeks ago.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And by 10 days ago, most of the country had been destroyed.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.57,0:22:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,But on that day, Nami and the others arrived here.Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That can only be described as a miracle!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.23,0:22:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,If not for their courage and Chopper's medical expertise,Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,every single person in the Mokomo Dukedom would've been helplessly killed...Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:40.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that it just happened and it still hurts,Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.93,0:22:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,so if you don't want to talk about it, that's fine but...Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'll tell you everything.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You-teia people have the right to know everything.Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.65,0:22:51.12,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.35,0:22:57.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama has woken up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:03.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.23,0:23:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama... He's all right now...Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:14.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's go examine his condition now!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:16.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Miyagi! Tristan!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait for me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:22.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay! Let me go at it and learn from you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Dr. Miyagi! You're hopping too much!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:31.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.09,0:23:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke Inuarashi said he'd like to see the saviors!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be right up!Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.65,0:23:40.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You-teia guys, will you come with me?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.45,0:23:43.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah but who's Inuarashi?Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the duke of the Mokomo Dukedom.Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.65,0:23:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means he's the ruler of the country!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:54.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He'd been in a coma ever since the city was wiped out.Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:56.16,Main,,0,0,0,,So has the other one.Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:23:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The other one?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:02.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! This country has two rulers!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.89,0:24:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,"King of the Day" - Duke Inuarashi!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.49,Main,,0,0,0,,"King of the Night" - Master Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You came for us!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.47,0:24:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain, it's amazing that you beat Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.27,0:24:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's Straw Hat-ya's...Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.94,0:24:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to catch up on! Let's go deeper into the forest!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.54,0:25:00.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:06.43,Captions,,0,0,175,,The Rightflank FortressDialogue: 0,0:25:06.43,0:25:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But it happened half a month ago.Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:16.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It was 17 days ago to be exact.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.47,0:25:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, the first time in a month and a half since Bepo and the others arrived,Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,the visitor's bell rang all over the Mokomo Dukedom.Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That was...Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.47,0:25:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,...the seldom-heard Raiding Bell!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that bell?Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.69,0:25:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the Raiding Bell!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.45,0:25:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:46.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Raiding?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.35,0:25:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,No wonder a young lady like you-gara doesn't know.Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.77,0:25:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It rarely rings.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.25,0:25:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The gate has been broken down! It's pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.59,0:26:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Cutting up the forest along the way, the enemy invaded our peaceful city.Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.43,0:26:05.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Feeling such unusual movement, Zunesha roared!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.72,0:26:15.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Who were they?! What did they want?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.55,0:26:22.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If our vicious enemies want something that we don't have...Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,How can we give it to them?Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.81,0:26:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, give him to us now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you have a warrior from the Land of Wano named Raizou here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:41.99,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi Sewil  QC: Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Translation: Yibis, Crunchyroll